        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-5064] After receiving the PowerDeliveryRes with ResponseCode equal to \"OK\" as a response to a previous PowerDeliveryReq message with ChargeProgress equal to \"Standby\", the EVCC shall send a WPT_ChargeLoopReq with PowerRequest set to zero, while V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Timer is smaller than V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Time.",
